2. Trafficking and Distribution
Considered a serious criminal offense
Can result in significant prison sentences
Harsher penalties apply for organized crime or large quantities
3. Importation

Importing DMT—whether by mail or by carrying it across borders—is illegal.

Belgian customs authorities actively monitor:

International packages
Online purchases
Cross-border transport

Seizures can lead to prosecution, even for small quantities.

