Misconceptions About DMT Legality
“DMT Is Natural, So It Must Be Legal”

False. Many illegal drugs occur naturally. Belgian law focuses on the psychoactive compound, not whether it is natural.

“Ayahuasca Is Legal for Spiritual Use”

False. Belgium does not recognize religious exemptions for DMT-containing substances.

“Small Amounts Are Allowed”

Misleading. While enforcement priorities may vary, possession of any amount is still illegal.

